# Task 149-016: Ed25519 Sign/Verify — Execution Plan

## Approach
1. Add `@noble/ed25519` and `@noble/hashes` dependencies to package.json
2. Create `src/core/signature.ts` with Ed25519 keypair generation, sign, verify
3. Create `tests/core/signature.test.ts` with 8 tests per spec
4. Run tsc --noEmit and vitest to verify

## Files to Create
- `src/core/signature.ts` (~150 LoC) — Ed25519 crypto module
- `tests/core/signature.test.ts` — 8 unit tests

## Files to Modify
- `package.json` — add @noble/ed25519 + @noble/hashes dependencies

## Key Design Decisions
- Use @noble/ed25519 v2 (pure JS, no native deps, audited)
- Use @noble/hashes for sha512 (required by ed25519)
- ESM imports (ADR-001, ADR-002)
- Async API (signAsync/verifyAsync) for modern patterns
- loadOrGenerateKeypair uses sync fs ops (ADR-005 deprecated but sync I/O still used in core)
- Keys stored in ~/.deckent/keys/ with restrictive permissions

## Test Plan
1. generateKeypair → 32-byte keys
2. sign + verify round-trip
3. Wrong public key → false
4. Tampered message → false
5. loadOrGenerateKeypair file creation
6. Private key file permissions 0600
7. Dir permissions 0700
8. Determinism: same msg + key → same sig
